 "gate_description": "Harness reproduction carries the advisory join. The side-binding check carries which arm is which and that both go through the same finding function. The orientation probe carries the direction of missed against phantom, on every paired field. The root-version requires carry the population. The double-count probe's reachable power is a membership test on the deduplicated join; it catches removal of the de-duplication and nothing subtler. The cutoff check constrains direction and a loose forward floor, and cannot establish that the cutoff was applied at all, because that needs per-node publish times and the packument cache was temporary. The flattening path has no gate.",
